  "details": "I have issues sometimes when using colliders on avatars where it interferes with movement. We should have the ability to choose whether to allow or disallow these collisions in the avatar descriptor or otherwise on an avatar to avatar basis. That way, flying avatars can still work but we can also disable inter-avatar collisions for avatars that aren't meant to have their movement affected by the colliders.",
